        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ogham House, Oghambawn, Tubbercurry, Co. SligoLuxury Five-Bedroom Bungalow\nLocated next door to Tubbercurry Golf Club and within a 1 km walk of Tubbercurry town centre, this is a fine family home that requires only a little touching up to make it ready for its new owners.\n\nBuilt within the last 20 years, the property is situated in an attractive residential area with a pleasant mix of residents of different ages and family sizes.\n\nThe beautiful Tubbercurry Golf Course is located directly to the rear, while Holy Family Primary School is situated on the same road, between the property and the town centre.\n\nA good-sized detached garage to the rear would be ideal for use as a workshop, office or additional storage space. Some of the bedrooms could also be converted into home offices, if required.\n\nPotential, potential, potential!\n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Porch 1.8 m x 1.8 m Tiled floor\nEntrance Hall 5.6 m x 1.8 m Timber floor\nSitting Room 5.5 m x 5 m Open fireplace and timber floor\nKitchen/Dining Area 8.3 m x 4.2 m Built-in kitchen units, tiled and timber floors, and solid-fuel stove\nConservatory (off dining area) 4 m x 3 m Timber floor\nUtility Room (off kitchen) 1.8 m x 2.7 m Fitted units and tiled floor\nRear Hallway 4 m x 1.5 m Timber floor\nBedroom 1 3.3 m x 2.7 m Timber floor\nBedroom 2 3 m x 3.8 m Timber floor\nBedroom 3 3.3 m x 3.2 m Timber floor\nBedroom 4 4.5 m x 3.2 m Timber floor \n\nEn Suite 1.8 m x 1.8 m WC, WHB and electric shower\n\nBedroom 5 4.6 m x 4.2 m Timber floor \n\nEn Suite 2.6 m x 3.8 m Walk-in wardrobe, WC, WHB and bath/shower\n\nFamily Bathroom 2.3 m x 2 m Fully tiled floor and walls, bath, WC and WHB\nDetached Garage 5.4 m x 4.7 m Roller doors\n\nFeatures\n\nOil-fired central heating\nDouble-glazed windows\nTimber and tiled floors throughout\nLean-to connected to the detached garage\nPatio area to the rear and side\nFront garden\nTarmac driveway\n\nLocation\n\nTubbercurry Golf Club to the rear\nWithin 1 km of Holy Family Primary School\n15 minutes from Ballymote Train Station\n20 minutes from Ireland West Airport Knock\n30 minutes from Sligo town\n45 minutes from Castlebar and Ballina\n90 minutes from Galway\n\nFor More Details\n\nEmail: info@reamccarrick.ie\nPhone: +353 71 91 85050\n\n"
      },
